                    for(int l=1;l<lo;l++){ ull gl=G[l]; if(gl==1)dp[l]=dp[l]*arm%MOD; else if(gl!=ar){ull f=ar/gl; dp[l]=dp[l]*(ll)(f%(ull)MOD)%MOD;} }
                }
